# Vendored at build time from the `katex` npm package by
# scripts/sync-katex-assets.mjs (see §2.4 — self-hosted, never a CDN).
# A derived artifact, not source: `npm run dev` and `npm run build` both
# regenerate it, and committing it would mean a KaTeX upgrade silently serving
# last version's fonts.
public/katex/
